        "\\sum_{k=1}^N2^{-k}\\tan\\frac1{4\\cdot2^k}=2^{-N}\\cot\\frac1{4\\cdot2^N}-\\cot\\frac1{4}",
        "u_N=\\frac1{4\\cdot2^N}\\longrightarrow0^+,\\qquad2^{-N}\\cot u_N=4\\,u_N\\cot u_N\\longrightarrow4",
        "\\textnormal{All angles used here are positive and at most one quarter of a radian, so no trigonometric pole is crossed.}",
        "\\sum_{k=1}^\\infty2^{-k}\\tan\\frac1{4\\cdot2^k}=4-\\cot\\frac1{4}",
        "4 - \\frac{1}{\\tan{\\left(\\frac{1}{4} \\right)}}"
